# Binary fixtures must never be line-ending-normalised: a PDF without a NUL byte
# looks like text to git's heuristic, and core.autocrlf=true on the Windows
# laptop would CRLF-mangle it on checkout (Phase 22 Task 8's delivery-receipt.pdf).
*.pdf  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
